{"seq":2,"slug":"shared-state","title":"共享状态与 Mutex","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/shared-state","wordCount":871,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"共享状态与-mutex\">共享状态与 Mutex</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当数据必须被多个线程读写时，Rust 要求它被显式地保护起来——<code>Mutex</code> 提供互斥访问，<code>RwLock</code> 区分读写，而 <code>Arc</code> 提供跨线程的共享所有权。理解本篇的关键，是看清 <code>Arc&lt;Mutex&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code> 这个组合为何成为标准答案：<strong>两个类型各自解决一个问题，互不重叠</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>Arc</code> 解决&quot;谁能拥有&quot;</strong>：原子引用计数让多线程共享同一份数据的所有权。</li>\n<li><strong><code>Mutex</code> 解决&quot;谁能访问&quot;</strong>：同一时刻只有一个线程能获得 <code>MutexGuard</code>，且该 Guard 的析构保证锁一定被释放。</li>\n<li><strong>锁中毒是设计的一部分</strong>：持有锁的线程 panic 会让锁被标记，迫使后续调用者显式决定是恢复数据还是放弃。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"共享状态并发\">共享状态并发</h2><p>当多个线程需要读写同一数据时，需要同步原语来保证数据一致性。Rust 通过类型系统确保共享数据必须被正确保护。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;线程 1&quot;] --&gt;|lock| M[&quot;Mutex&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;线程 2&quot;] --&gt;|lock| M&#10;    C[&quot;线程 3&quot;] --&gt;|lock| M&#10;    M --&gt;|保护| D[&quot;共享数据 T&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"线程 1\"] --&gt;|lock| M[\"Mutex&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;\"]\n    B[\"线程 2\"] --&gt;|lock| M\n    C[\"线程 3\"] --&gt;|lock| M\n    M --&gt;|保护| D[\"共享数据 T\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"mutex-t-互斥锁\">Mutex&lt;T&gt;：互斥锁</h2><p><code>Mutex&lt;T&gt;</code> 保证同一时刻只有一个线程能访问内部数据。调用 <code>lock()</code> 获取锁，返回的 <code>MutexGuard</code> 在离开作用域时自动释放锁。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::{Arc, Mutex};&#10;use std::thread;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let counter = Arc::new(Mutex::new(0));&#10;    let mut handles = vec![];&#10;&#10;    for _ in 0..10 {&#10;        let counter = Arc::clone(&amp;counter);&#10;        let handle = thread::spawn(move || {&#10;            let mut num = counter.lock().unwrap();&#10;            *num += 1;&#10;        });&#10;        handles.push(handle);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    for handle in handles {&#10;        handle.join().unwrap();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;最终计数: {}&quot;, *counter.lock().unwrap());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::{Arc, Mutex};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let counter = Arc::new(Mutex::new(0));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut handles = vec![];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for _ in 0..10 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let counter = Arc::clone(&#x26;counter);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let handle = thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let mut num = counter.lock().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            *num += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handles.push(handle);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for handle in handles {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handle.join().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"最终计数: {}\", *counter.lock().unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"mutex-api\">Mutex API</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>lock()</code></td>\n<td>阻塞等待锁，返回 <code>LockResult&lt;MutexGuard&gt;</code></td>\n<td>大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>try_lock()</code></td>\n<td>非阻塞尝试获取锁，返回 <code>TryLockResult</code></td>\n<td>避免死锁、轮询场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>into_inner()</code></td>\n<td>消耗 Mutex，提取内部数据</td>\n<td>不再需要共享时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>get_mut()</code></td>\n<td>独占访问时直接获取可变引用</td>\n<td>已有 <code>&amp;mut Mutex</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"锁中毒-poisoning\">锁中毒（Poisoning）</h2><p>如果持有锁的线程 panic，锁会被标记为&quot;中毒&quot;。后续的 <code>lock()</code> 调用返回 <code>Err</code>，但仍可通过 <code>into_inner()</code> 获取数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::{Arc, Mutex};&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let data = Arc::new(Mutex::new(vec![1, 2, 3]));&#10;&#10;    let data_clone = Arc::clone(&amp;data);&#10;    let handle = std::thread::spawn(move || {&#10;        let mut guard = data_clone.lock().unwrap();&#10;        guard.push(4);&#10;        panic!(&quot;线程崩溃!&quot;);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    let _ = handle.join();&#10;&#10;    match data.lock() {&#10;        Ok(guard) =&gt; println!(&quot;数据: {:?}&quot;, *guard),&#10;        Err(poisoned) =&gt; {&#10;            let guard = poisoned.into_inner();&#10;            println!(&quot;锁中毒，但数据可恢复: {:?}&quot;, *guard);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::{Arc, Mutex};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let data = Arc::new(Mutex::new(vec![1, 2, 3]));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let data_clone = Arc::clone(&#x26;data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let handle = std::thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut guard = data_clone.lock().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        guard.push(4);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        panic!(\"线程崩溃!\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let _ = handle.join();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match data.lock() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(guard) => println!(\"数据: {:?}\", *guard),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(poisoned) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let guard = poisoned.into_inner();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"锁中毒，但数据可恢复: {:?}\", *guard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"rwlock-t-读写锁\">RwLock&lt;T&gt;：读写锁</h2><p><code>RwLock</code> 允许多个读者同时访问，但写者独占。适合读多写少的场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::{Arc, RwLock};&#10;use std::thread;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let config = Arc::new(RwLock::new(String::from(&quot;初始配置&quot;)));&#10;    let mut handles = vec![];&#10;&#10;    for i in 0..5 {&#10;        let config = Arc::clone(&amp;config);&#10;        handles.push(thread::spawn(move || {&#10;            let r = config.read().unwrap();&#10;            println!(&quot;读者 {}: {}&quot;, i, *r);&#10;        }));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    {&#10;        let config = Arc::clone(&amp;config);&#10;        handles.push(thread::spawn(move || {&#10;            let mut w = config.write().unwrap();&#10;            *w = String::from(&quot;更新后的配置&quot;);&#10;            println!(&quot;写者: 配置已更新&quot;);&#10;        }));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    for h in handles {&#10;        h.join().unwrap();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::{Arc, RwLock};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let config = Arc::new(RwLock::new(String::from(\"初始配置\")));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut handles = vec![];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..5 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let config = Arc::clone(&#x26;config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handles.push(thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let r = config.read().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"读者 {}: {}\", i, *r);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let config = Arc::clone(&#x26;config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handles.push(thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let mut w = config.write().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            *w = String::from(\"更新后的配置\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"写者: 配置已更新\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for h in handles {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        h.join().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"mutex-vs-rwlock-对比\">Mutex vs RwLock 对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th><code>Mutex&lt;T&gt;</code></th>\n<th><code>RwLock&lt;T&gt;</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读并发</td>\n<td>不允许（互斥）</td>\n<td>允许多个读者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写并发</td>\n<td>互斥</td>\n<td>互斥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能（读多写少）</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能（写频繁）</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>较低（写饥饿风险）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>稍复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死锁风险</td>\n<td>递归锁会死锁</td>\n<td>读锁升级写锁会死锁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"arc-mutex-模式\">Arc + Mutex 模式</h2><p>跨线程共享可变数据的标准模式是 <code>Arc&lt;Mutex&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code>：<code>Arc</code> 提供线程安全的共享所有权，<code>Mutex</code> 提供互斥访问。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::collections::HashMap;&#10;use std::sync::{Arc, Mutex};&#10;use std::thread;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let map = Arc::new(Mutex::new(HashMap::new()));&#10;    let mut handles = vec![];&#10;&#10;    for i in 0..5 {&#10;        let map = Arc::clone(&amp;map);&#10;        handles.push(thread::spawn(move || {&#10;            let mut m = map.lock().unwrap();&#10;            m.insert(format!(&quot;key_{}&quot;, i), i * 10);&#10;        }));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    for h in handles {&#10;        h.join().unwrap();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;结果: {:?}&quot;, map.lock().unwrap());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::collections::HashMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::{Arc, Mutex};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let map = Arc::new(Mutex::new(HashMap::new()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut handles = vec![];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..5 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let map = Arc::clone(&#x26;map);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handles.push(thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let mut m = map.lock().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            m.insert(format!(\"key_{}\", i), i * 10);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for h in handles {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        h.join().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"结果: {:?}\", map.lock().unwrap());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"避免死锁\">避免死锁</h2><p>死锁常见于多个锁的嵌套获取。以下策略可以减少死锁风险：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定加锁顺序</td>\n<td>所有线程以相同顺序获取多个锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩小锁粒度</td>\n<td>尽量减小临界区范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 <code>try_lock()</code></td>\n<td>非阻塞尝试，失败时释放已持有的锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免锁嵌套</td>\n<td>尽量在持有锁时不再获取其他锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用通道替代共享状态</td>\n<td>消息传递天然避免死锁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::Mutex;&#10;&#10;fn safe_transfer(&#10;    from: &amp;Mutex&lt;i64&gt;,&#10;    to: &amp;Mutex&lt;i64&gt;,&#10;    amount: i64,&#10;) {&#10;    let (first, second) = if std::ptr::from_ref(from) &lt; std::ptr::from_ref(to) {&#10;        (from, to)&#10;    } else {&#10;        (to, from)&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    let mut a = first.lock().unwrap();&#10;    let mut b = second.lock().unwrap();&#10;&#10;    if std::ptr::from_ref(from) &lt; std::ptr::from_ref(to) {&#10;        *a -= amount;&#10;        *b += amount;&#10;    } else {&#10;        *b -= amount;&#10;        *a += amount;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::Mutex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn safe_transfer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    from: &#x26;Mutex&#x3C;i64>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    to: &#x26;Mutex&#x3C;i64>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    amount: i64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (first, second) = if std::ptr::from_ref(from) &#x3C; std::ptr::from_ref(to) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (from, to)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (to, from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut a = first.lock().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut b = second.lock().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if std::ptr::from_ref(from) &#x3C; std::ptr::from_ref(to) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        *a -= amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        *b += amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        *b -= amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        *a += amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"parking_lot-高性能替代\">parking_lot：高性能替代</h2><p><code>parking_lot</code> crate 提供了比标准库更高效的同步原语，且不会中毒。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th><code>std::sync::Mutex</code></th>\n<th><code>parking_lot::Mutex</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>锁中毒</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API</td>\n<td><code>lock()</code> 返回 <code>Result</code></td>\n<td><code>lock()</code> 直接返回 Guard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n<td>更高（更小的锁）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可重入</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td><code>ReentrantMutex</code> 可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公平性</td>\n<td>不保证</td>\n<td>可选公平锁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨线程共享可变数据的标准模式是 <code>Arc&lt;Mutex&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code>：<code>Arc</code> 管所有权，<code>Mutex</code> 管访问互斥。</li>\n<li><code>MutexGuard</code> 在离开作用域时自动释放锁，因此不会像手动加解锁那样遗忘释放。</li>\n<li>读多写少可用 <code>RwLock</code>，但需注意写饥饿风险；写频繁时 <code>Mutex</code> 往往更划算。</li>\n<li>锁中毒机制在持有者 panic 时保护数据一致性，可通过 <code>into_inner()</code> 恢复。</li>\n<li>死锁可通过固定加锁顺序、缩小临界区、<code>try_lock()</code> 或改用通道来规避。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"共享状态与 Mutex","id":"共享状态与-mutex"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"共享状态并发","id":"共享状态并发"},{"level":2,"text":"Mutex\\<T\\>：互斥锁","id":"mutex-t-互斥锁"},{"level":3,"text":"Mutex API","id":"mutex-api"},{"level":2,"text":"锁中毒（Poisoning）","id":"锁中毒-poisoning"},{"level":2,"text":"RwLock\\<T\\>：读写锁","id":"rwlock-t-读写锁"},{"level":2,"text":"Mutex vs RwLock 对比","id":"mutex-vs-rwlock-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Arc + Mutex 模式","id":"arc-mutex-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"避免死锁","id":"避免死锁"},{"level":2,"text":"parking_lot：高性能替代","id":"parking_lot-高性能替代"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"线程与消息传递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/threads-and-channels"},"next":{"title":"async/await 与异步运行时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/async-await"}}